Lunduke's Linux Kernel (lunduke-linux-kernel)
=============================================

Metapackage for linux-image-7.2.6-lunduke (ABI lcos13). Recommends matching
headers.

LCOS 0.8 ISOs shipped 7.2.6-lcos12 (that config stays frozen). This
metapackage is the lcos13 revision of the same 7.2.6-lunduke image name.
On older LCOS releases that still ship a Distro/Devuan kernel, install
from the apt overlay, reboot, and pick 7.2.6-lunduke in GRUB (or set it once).

  sudo apt update
  sudo apt install lunduke-linux-kernel

Apt overlay: https://lcos.lunduke.com/apt

lcos13: Intel laptop buses, UART Bluetooth, Intel SOF and AMD ACP machine
drivers, USB Ethernet, Realtek card readers, hwmon/idle, IWLMLD,
in-tree Surface Aggregator, vendor hotkeys.
No Forced Rust. No Rust Android binder. lcos12 stays frozen.
